      "type": "text",
      "x": 64,
      "y": 174,
      "width": 442,
      "height": 247.5,
      "text": "REQUIREMENTS\n\n• ~500K active tokens\n• Human / Pipeline / Agent identity\n• Least privilege + audience binding\n• Prevent replay of stolen token\n• Detect suspicious token use\n• Emergency revoke in seconds\n• Alert owner / security\n• Fresh auth before replacement\n• Multi-region + auditable",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "REQUIREMENTS\n\n• ~500K active tokens\n• Human / Pipeline / Agent identity\n• Least privilege + audience binding\n• Prevent replay of stolen token\n• Detect suspicious token use\n• Emergency revoke in seconds\n• Alert owner / security\n• Fresh auth before replacement\n• Multi-region + auditable",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
