      "type": "text",
      "x": 1124,
      "y": 174,
      "width": 482,
      "height": 270,
      "text": "Do NOT build:\n500K long-lived API keys.\n\nBuild:\nlong-lived identity\n      ↓ authenticate\nshort-lived grant/token\n      ↓\nlocal authorization\n\nCentralize control plane, not every API auth\ncheck.",
      "fontSize": 18,
