      "originalText": "Do NOT build:\n500K long-lived API keys.\n\nBuild:\nlong-lived identity\n      ↓ authenticate\nshort-lived grant/token\n      ↓\nlocal authorization\n\nCentralize control plane, not every API auth check.",
