      "id": "t45",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 64,
      "y": 1634,
      "width": 472,
      "height": 272,
      "text": "DEFENSE IN DEPTH\n\n• 5–15m access-token TTL\n• audience restriction\n• minimal scopes\n• DPoP / mTLS sender binding\n• refresh-token rotation\n• BFF + HttpOnly browser session\n• workload identity, not CI secrets\n• KMS/HSM signing keys\n• no raw token in logs\n• per-tool audience for agents",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "DEFENSE IN DEPTH\n\n• 5–15m access-token TTL\n• audience restriction\n• minimal scopes\n• DPoP / mTLS sender binding\n• refresh-token rotation\n• BFF + HttpOnly browser session\n• workload identity, not CI secrets\n• KMS/HSM signing keys\n• no raw token in logs\n• per-tool audience for agents",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "a90R",
      "roundness": null
    },
