      "locked": false,
      "id": "t100",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 624,
      "y": 3584,
      "width": 452,
      "height": 312,
      "text": "JWT VS OPAQUE\n\nJWT\n+ fast/local\n- revoke harder\n\nOpaque + introspection\n+ immediate central control\n- network dependency\n\nRECOMMENDED:\nshort JWT\n+ stateful grant\n+ JTI denylist\n+ security epoch\n+ optional introspection for P0 APIs",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "JWT VS OPAQUE\n\nJWT\n+ fast/local\n- revoke harder\n\nOpaque + introspection\n+ immediate central control\n- network dependency\n\nRECOMMENDED:\nshort JWT\n+ stateful grant\n+ JTI denylist\n+ security epoch\n+ optional introspection for P0 APIs",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "a99",
      "roundness": null
    },
    {
